## pstack

This package ports **pstack**, originally published as part of
[`cursor/plugins`](https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/main/pstack), into
DeepSeek Harness.

- Author: Lauren Tan (https://github.com/poteto)
- License: MIT
- Upstream version at the time of this port: see
  `upstream/cursor-plugins/pstack/plugin.json`
- Upstream commit: see `git submodule status upstream/cursor-plugins`

The upstream text is fetched as a git submodule and converted by
`scripts/sync-upstream.ts` into `assets/skills/`, `assets/agents/`, and
`assets/docs/`. The converted tree is checked in so the published package needs
no network access and no build-time checkout.

