## Modifications

The conversion changes, at minimum:

- Cursor's `Task` tool is replaced by `pstack_subagent`.
- Cursor model slugs are replaced by role names resolved from
  `~/.dsh/pstack-models.md`.
- Cursor paths (`~/.cursor/...`) are replaced by DSH paths (`~/.dsh/...`).
- Cursor-only steps (Automations, Bugbot, cloud agents, Custom Modes, `/loop`,
  `cursor-team-kit`) are marked skipped or remapped to DSH equivalents.
- `skills/make-bot-ui` is excluded because it depends on Cursor Automations.
- Cursor display frontmatter (`icon`, `color`) is dropped; only DSH skill
  frontmatter is emitted.
